{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN1.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/ShapeFate.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a forgotten starfarer carrying a mysterious cargo. As you awaken on the edge of a fragmented galaxy, you gain the power to take over the lives of 600+ AI-driven NPCs\u2014each with unique goals, secrets, and destinies. You may inherit their missions or forge new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN2.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Starmap_Progress.jpg?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The galaxy is fading. Explore forgotten navigation charts, reconnect dormant networks, and restore the broken flow of interstellar trade. Each journey between stars reawakens fragments of a forgotten age.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN3.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/AI_NPC.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your AI companion and AI-powered NPCs are more than just tools\u2014They remember, reason, and may disagree. Every character is powered by AI and evolves based on how you treat them. Your relationships can spark alliances, chaos, or betrayals that ripple across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN4.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Meeting.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing is scripted. Quests, conversations, and world events are generated live by our AI worldline system. You might find yourself in a forgotten comms room\u2014or uncover messages written in your own hand. Every playthrough is a collapse of infinite futures into one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN5.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/e.\u63a2\u7d22\u4f4d\u7f6e\u53d1\u73b0\u5730\u8c8c.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade goods, rebuild outposts, and grow influence\u2014or dive solo into ruined zones to scavenge secrets. No two runs play the same, and each decision opens new paths through a world that changes with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN6.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Characters1920x1080.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not the cosmos of physics textbooks. You\u2019re navigating a fractured sci-fi world of dead languages, abandoned tech, flickering memories, and eerie architecture. A civilization lost to time\u2014ready to be pieced back together, or rewritten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN7.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/RewriteHistory.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the Quantum Observer to glimpse possible futures, then act to bring one into reality. In this world of uncertainty and fading records, the version of history that survives may be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN8.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3105960?t=1749610584","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749610584","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/3489e315e5bdfeefc7ae333ce1dd926f3c80a1bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749610584","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/3489e315e5bdfeefc7ae333ce1dd926f3c80a1bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749610584","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it