<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN4.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Meeting.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nothing is scripted. Quests, conversations, and world events are generated live by our AI worldline system. You might find yourself in a forgotten comms room\u2014or uncover messages written in your own hand. Every playthrough is a collapse of infinite futures into one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN5.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/e.\u63a2\u7d22\u4f4d\u7f6e\u53d1\u73b0\u5730\u8c8c.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade goods, rebuild outposts, and grow influence\u2014or dive solo into ruined zones to scavenge secrets. No two runs play the same, and each decision opens new paths through a world that changes with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN6.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Characters1920x1080.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is not the cosmos of physics textbooks. You\u2019re navigating a fractured sci-fi world of dead languages, abandoned tech, flickering memories, and eerie architecture. A civilization lost to time\u2014ready to be pieced back together, or rewritten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN7.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/RewriteHistory.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the Quantum Observer to glimpse possible futures, then act to bring one into reality. In this world of uncertainty and fading records, the version of history that survives may be yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/\u5b50\u6807\u9898EN8.png?t=1749610584\" /></div></p>","developers":["wastudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/ae084b04f55d3a1cbdb661e6631ec24b664f999a/header.jpg?t=1749610584","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257091841,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091841/movie480.mp4?t=1741947287","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091841/movie_max.mp4?t=1741947287"},"name":"Astrobuilder gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257091841/658244fe5c50988ef8e5d72789f3a4c8597f1419/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741947287","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091841/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741947287","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257091841/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741947287"}}],"name":"Astrobuilder","package_groups":[],"pc_